Status rules:

```txt
DRAFT — statement is being edited
READY_TO_SEND — statement is complete but not sent
SENT — statement was sent or manually marked as sent
UNPAID — total paid amount is 0 and due date is not passed
PARTIALLY_PAID — total paid amount is greater than 0 but less than total amount
PAID — total paid amount equals total amount
OVERPAID — total paid amount is greater than total amount
OVERDUE — due date passed and total paid amount is less than total amount
CANCELLED — statement should not be collected
```

The app may calculate payment-based statuses dynamically instead of storing them permanently.

